xt\":\"**Drafting a reply**\\n\\nI’m looking to create a reply that includes a link and suggests bringing it up in the meeting. I should mention a timing confirmation for \\\"tomorrow\\\" to ensure clarity. It’s important to keep the message concise. I plan to reply directly in the thread to Dana, but I want to make sure it’s just a draft for now, not for sending just yet. Let's use the mail draft feature to do that!\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_0b448754b198ab42016af1295fc1ec87d0b437f856acac3325\",\"call_id\":\"call_48rzyWSvxs6v5T6s3IFW6811\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"draft\\\",\\\"to\\\":[\\\"dana@example.test\\\"],\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\n\\\\nI’ll bring the latest Q3 budget sheet to the planning review. Here’s the link: [Q3 Budget](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\\\n\\\\nBest,\\\\nSam\\\",\\\"reply_to\\\":\\\"msg_c5ee0b577c2a4eff\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_48rzyWSvxs6v5T6s3IFW6811\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"draft\\\": \\\"msg_60c7054b49254501\\\",\\n  \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_63437fd9fda34c00\\\",\\n  \\\"to\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\"\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be09-4e1a-74ee-a458-6512c5de3e08\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
